      "code_hash": "1bc161381af527e147d75ff407b84c75",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"notes-for-the-next-session\">Notes for the next session</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Molab kills idle sessions after 90 min and every session at 12 h. Checkpoints live in\n  <code>submissions/checkpoints/</code> and resume automatically; set <code>HF_RUNS_REPO</code> + <code>HF_TOKEN</code> and flip the\n  HF push switch so nothing is lost.</li>\n<li>Noise band on held-out is about \u00b10.005 combined. Only keep a lever if it wins by \u2265 0.003.</li>\n<li>The knowledge graph for this project is in <code>vault/</code> (Obsidian). Log every run in <code>vault/Experiment History.md</code>.</li>\n</ul></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
